practice to think about this experience,

00:31:25.034 --> 00:31:26.504
NGAL BA DON MED,

00:31:27.495 --> 00:31:29.294
it is useless effort.

00:31:30.075 --> 00:31:32.504
Meaningless exertion.

00:31:33.160 --> 00:31:37.660
It's a meaningless work that you're doing with tantra

00:31:37.920 --> 00:31:40.100
if you're not working on this state of mind.

00:31:40.100 --> 00:31:45.260
Everything else becomes 
meaningless, exhausting yourself.

00:31:45.260 --> 00:31:47.600
NGAL BA means to 
exhaust yourself without any point.

00:31:48.810 --> 00:31:50.760
DE HA CANG PHANGS PA YIN GSUNGS,

00:31:50.760 --> 00:31:55.040
And there would be no greater loss in your life,

00:31:55.040 --> 00:31:55.580
Okay.

00:31:56.820 --> 00:31:58.950
to spend your life that way. 

00:32:00.030 --> 00:32:04.230
That'd be like going to Paris a
thousand times and not getting a croissant.

00:32:05.720 --> 00:32:10.000
So, that completes this section of the text.

00:32:10.040 --> 00:32:13.317
We're going to be going on during the next retreat.

00:32:13.317 --> 00:32:17.880
Next retreat, again, we're going to 
focus on Medicine Buddha practice,

00:32:17.880 --> 00:32:19.180
 because of the virus.

00:32:19.950 --> 00:32:22.020
And it's a very powerful practice.

00:32:22.050 --> 00:32:27.270
And obviously we'll try to do it as
much as we can with this attitude of

00:32:28.260 --> 00:32:32.070
love for every person in the
universe, not just for this planet.

00:32:32.100 --> 00:32:33.990
This is a small world.

00:32:34.590 --> 00:32:36.270
There are billions of worlds like this.

00:32:36.419 --> 00:32:41.639
And if we can have this greater focus, I don't know,

00:32:43.500 --> 00:32:46.680
it's like if you catch all the fish in the ocean, 

00:32:46.840 --> 00:32:48.780
you can catch one fish that you want.

00:32:48.840 --> 00:32:49.439
You see what I mean?

00:32:50.040 --> 00:32:50.939
Something like that.

00:32:50.969 --> 00:32:52.933
I mean, we don't want to catch fish,

00:32:52.940 --> 00:32:56.420
but, if you could catch all the fish in the whole ocean,

00:32:56.420 --> 00:32:59.260
 then probably the one you would really like,

00:32:59.860 --> 00:33:02.260
maybe it's a Ju, what's it called, Juju Fish?

00:33:03.500 --> 00:33:04.820
You probably catch the one you want.

00:33:05.835 --> 00:33:08.055
So, we'll see you in episode 15.

00:33:08.680 --> 00:33:14.940
We're going to be doing a
review of all of the big ideas of this course,

00:33:14.940 --> 00:33:16.420
 and it's good for you and it's good for me. 

00:33:16.420 --> 00:33:19.080
We've been going through very carefully

00:33:19.680 --> 00:33:21.420
bit by bit by bit.

00:33:22.320 --> 00:33:26.460
And if we can go back 
and review everything in one session,

00:33:26.620 --> 00:33:32.200
then we can get an appreciation for 
the flow and it will be easier to remember

00:33:32.220 --> 00:33:33.580
what happened during this retreat.

00:33:34.590 --> 00:33:35.160
See you then.

